 <div class=\"resource-eyebrow\">专属资源</div>\n        <div class=\"resource-title\">预设与世界书</div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"resource-badge\">8bit</span>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"resource-card\">\n      <span class=\"resource-label\">专属预设</span>\n      <strong>{{ game.dedicatedResourceNames.preset }}</strong>\n      <p>来源为 Git 发布资源：{{ game.dedicatedResourceNames.resourceDir }}/{{ game.dedicatedResourceNames.presetFile }}</p>\n      <p>导入后会立即切换为当前酒馆预设，正文生成继续走酒馆预设。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"resource-card\">\n      <span class=\"resource-label\">专属世界书</span>\n      <strong>{{ game.dedicatedResourceNames.worldbook }}</strong>\n      <p>来源为 Git 发布资源：{{ game.dedicatedResourceNames.resourceDir }}/{{ game.dedicatedResourceNames.worldbookFile }}</p>\n      <p>按条目名合并：同名覆盖，缺失新增，已有的玩家个人条目保留，并启用为全局世界书。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"resource-actions\">\n      <button class=\"action-btn primary\" :disabled=\"game.isBusy\" @click=\"installAll\">一键安装</button>\n      <button class=\"action-btn\" :disabled=\"game.isBusy\" @click=\"installPresetOnly\">只启用预设</button>\n      <button class=\"action-btn gold\" :disabled=\"game.isBusy\" @click=\"mergeWorldbookOnly\">只合并世界书</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div v-if=\"lastResultLines.length\" class=\"resource-result\">\n      <span>本次结果</span>\n      <p v-for=\"line in lastResultLines\" :key=\"line\">{{ line }}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <p v-if=\"game.lastNotice\" class=\"resource-notice\">{{ game.lastNotice }}</p>\n    <p v-if=\"game.lastError\" class=\"resource-error\">{{ game.lastError }}</p>\n  </section>\n</template>\n\n<style scoped>\n.dedicated-resource-panel {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.resource-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.resource-eyebrow {\n  color: var(--p5-red);\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: 3px;\n}\n\n.resource-title {\n  margin-top: 2px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 900;\n}\n\n.resource-badge {\n  background: var(--p5-gold);\n  color: #000;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  transform: skewX(-8deg);\n}\n\n.resource-card,\n.resource-result {\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--p5-red);\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);\n  padding: 12px;\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.resource-card strong {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n.resource-card p,\n.resource-result p,\n.resource-notice,\n.resource-error {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: var(--p5-gray);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n}\n\n.resource-label,\n.resource-result span {\n  color: var(--p5-gray-dim);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n.resource-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.resource-actions .action-btn {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  padding: 7px 12px;\n}\n\n.resource-notice {\n  color: var(--p5-safe);\n}\n\n.resource-error {\n  color: var(--p5-hp);\n}\n</style>\n"],"sourceRoot":""}]);
